    {"id": "tokyo-attractions", "text": "Must-see in Tokyo: Senso-ji Temple (Asakusa), Shibuya Crossing, Meiji Shrine, teamLab Planets digital art (book ahead), Tsukiji outer market, Tokyo Skytree, Harajuku Takeshita Street, Akihabara electronics/anime district. Day trips: Nikko, Kamakura, Hakone (Mt Fuji views).", "source": "destination-guide", "destination": "tokyo", "category": "attractions"},
